{"ticker":{"symbol":"004890.KS","name":"동일산업","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":34700.0,"change_pct":0.043609022556390986,"market_cap":74310950912.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.02881844380403458,"week52_low":32000.0,"week52_high":42150.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","country":"South Korea","city":"Pohang","employees":189,"website":"https://www.dongil.co.kr","business_summary":"Dongil Industries Co.,Ltd. operates in the steel industry in South Korea. It manufactures hot rolled steel bars; cold drawn bars used in manufacturing parts for automobiles and industrial machinery, and electronic appliances; and CHQ wires used in manufacturing materials for fastener industries and automotive parts. The company also provides peeled bars that are used as parts in cold forged automotive parts, cylinders, and shafts of heavy equipment; and abrasive steel rods used for products that control the burnout of the surface, such as LM guide. In addition, it offers ferro alloys, and steel casting products for excavators and wheel loaders, as well as abrasion resistant steel products. Dongil Industries Co.,Ltd. was founded in 1946 and is based in Pohang, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"동일산업(주) 한국의 철강 산업에 종사하고 있습니다. 열간압연 철근을 제조합니다. 자동차, 산업기계 부품, 전자제품 제조에 사용되는 냉간인발봉강; 패스너 산업 및 자동차 부품 제조 재료에 사용되는 CHQ 와이어. 이 회사는 또한 냉간 단조 자동차 부품, 실린더 및 중장비 샤프트의 부품으로 사용되는 박리 막대를 제공합니다. LM 가이드 등 표면의 소손을 제어하는 ​​제품에 사용되는 연마강봉 등이 있습니다. 또한 굴삭기, 휠로더용 철합금, 주강 제품, 내마모강 제품도 제공하고 있습니다. 동일산업(주) 1946년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 포항에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"철강","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":498050514990.0,"operating_income":22608890640.0,"net_income":21844965310.0,"eps":10085.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":441161261160.0,"operating_income":-4238627600.0,"net_income":-1075698290.0,"eps":-49